{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"e0ae0d4031db98fc86e0dd976d047b3fbfd44cedc9c3f390967959edb60c48cc","ja":"ドッペルゲンガーの正体","zh":"分身的真面目","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"14c7a65e7cf68b412eeb21904bd8778ec35af64a601ad488441d6e8fde353066","ja":"日が暮れ始めたころ、\nみんなは昨日、響を見た場所にやって来て……","zh":"傍晚时分，\n大家来到了昨天看到响的地方……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"7011d4534c85a0f8c428ccd6f72c52c62d36d8f87f98ff747985bd3da40979b3","ja":"まさに黄昏時といった時間ですね～。\n響さんらしい姿は見あたりませんが……あら？","zh":"真可谓是黄昏时分的时间呢～。\n虽然没看到像是响小姐的身影……哎呀？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e5e0214dce4aeef2692e28d0ae3dd7fa143f8818b60de29eca29f319f77d2c9d","ja":"みんな～！！","zh":"大家～！！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"38993ba97107f962cfd3445bb242fcb92e0ae3dec6ffc3b689174281b95d240b","ja":"はぁ、はぁ……！","zh":"哈，哈……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"b6e49314d291c5285d050bc008ca37189d2f6e5b1947cefa42b99788980c104b","ja":"ひ、響さん！\nここに来て大丈夫なんですか！？","zh":"响、响小姐！\n来这里真的没问题吗！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"2e509a5015567f55047293366130c3f4bafce4d54a23cbdf6e321e85d1f6edb7","ja":"だ、だ、だ、大丈夫じゃないぞ！\nでも、みんなのことが心配だったから……！","zh":"才、才、才、才不是没事呢！\n可是，因为很担心大家……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"3027f3dc0716be473c094454143a2995d77bcc3fae6093f7c90c9933b0424210","ja":"響さん、安心して！　ドッペルゲンガーは本人が\n見なければ大丈夫だから、出たら私が目隠しするね！","zh":"响，放心吧！只要分身灵没被本人\n看到就不要紧，要是出现了我会蒙住你的眼睛的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"962fbc850566a5ed2e35c7c10badf05fe1b782f2f9f8d073d494f0c44e3b94ab","ja":"いざという時は、私も響さんの盾になりましょう～。\n必ず、守ってみせますからね～。","zh":"到了关键时刻，我也来当响小姐的盾牌吧～。\n我一定会保护好你的～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"efea354c2afb4e198c80c81467eced3a8b48538f3fc16ed45be08893e95de461","ja":"わ、私もいざというときは何か……。\nえ～っと……大きな声で歌うとか……って、あ！","zh":"我、我也要在关键时刻做点什么……\n呃～……比如大声唱歌之类的……等等，啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"1fe99ba3e80bbfe1c05c579f1e57fbae0ae1a30583984f4ff016ffa74051e238","ja":"でた～っ！　あ、あの後ろ姿……！？\nひ、響さん、見たらダメです～～！","zh":"出来啦～！那、那个背影……！？\n响、响小姐，不能看啊～～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"4930e41ef74fee67309d2d5a3c42010982b8399f744a98c704503b8287c095df","ja":"（あれが自分のドッペルゲンガー……。\nあっ、振り返った！　このままだと、目が合って……）","zh":"（那就是我自己的分身……。\n啊，回头了！这样下去，会四目相对的……）","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[41].text","source_sha256":"94c47e71a7f809652716c93dcac4901345742e2813115851d14db6b4d4bcc329","ja":"数分後……","zh":"过了几分钟后……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[42].text","source_sha256":"afe6e5797f5d18e77f0d96e6a4baaad8321bcb29a83dc7bc727333158554397d","ja":"正体判明～♪　謎が解明～♪\nオバケじゃなくて、よかったな～♪","zh":"真相大白～♪　谜团解开～♪\n不是妖怪，真是太好啦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[43].text","source_sha256":"f4a521d51050b74c0170c66c7ccce3d6cb39f1a0d592a9ae7c8b272f103c4a01","ja":"まさかドッペルゲンガーの正体が、\n自分のファンの子だったなんて、びっくりだぞ！","zh":"没想到分身灵的真正面目，\n竟然是自己的小粉丝，太让人吃惊了！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[51].text","source_sha256":"4b624d34026b03f92413ca1b06b71bbd724fbf4d86f63a9aec6f03bbf6728c17","ja":"ふふっ。響さんに憧れて服装も髪型も\n真似したんだったら、似てて当然だよね。","zh":"呵呵。要是崇拜响小姐，连服装和发型都\n照着学的话，长得像也是理所当然的吧。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[52].text","source_sha256":"4cca9598fdf03246671a8593c8911f19d2748c8de79cd81f6cae39eadcf14d1c","ja":"黄昏時に憧れの人に出会う……。あの方には、\nきっと素敵な思い出になったことでしょう～。","zh":"在黄昏时分偶遇憧憬之人……对那位而言，\n一定是一段美好的回忆吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[60].text","source_sha256":"156048d293bab8ba0aded66101bad6e7034e11c45cd8c7dee7155dcf97a387ea","ja":"それは自分も同じさー！　だって、自分の真似をして\nくれるくらいのファンに会えたんだからね！","zh":"我也是一样的啦！毕竟，我可是遇到了\n甚至会模仿我的粉丝呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1142.unity3d","item_key":"commands[61].text","source_sha256":"a4a5268009999b43d8e8644ea1a649b70e804f83cae7daf86847be68160bda77","ja":"すっごく怖かったけど、来てよかったぞ！\nみんな、ありがとねっ！","zh":"虽然特别吓人，但能来真是太好了！\n大家，谢谢你们啦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:20:13+00:00"}
